---
import SectionLabel from './SectionLabel.astro';

interface Props {
  class?: string;
}

const { class: className } = Astro.props;
---

<section
  id="inicio"
  class:list={['border-b border-border/10 pt-[3.375rem] md:pt-[4.25rem]', className]}
>
  <div class="border-b border-border/10 px-4 md:px-6 lg:px-10 py-3 md:py-4">
    <p class="font-mono text-[0.6875rem] md:text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-muted-foreground">
      INÍCIO — MICHEL DE FREITAS
    </p>
  </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4">
    <div class="md:col-span-3 md:col-start-1 md:row-start-1 p-4 md:p-6 lg:p-10 border-b border-border/10 md:border-r flex flex-col items-start justify-start gap-6">
      <h1 class="font-sans font-bold uppercase leading-[0.85] -tracking-[0.04em] text-[clamp(3.25rem,13vw,9rem)] break-words">
        MICHEL
        <span class="block text-transparent [-webkit-text-stroke:1.5px_white] md:[-webkit-text-stroke:2px_white]">DE FREITAS</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="font-sans text-lg md:text-xl lg:text-2xl leading-snug max-w-3xl">
        Programo desde os 12 anos e atuo profissionalmente há mais de três. Meu trabalho é transformar problemas complexos em sistemas confiáveis: arquitetura, trade-offs e software que aguenta produção.
      </p>
      <p class="ml-[10px] font-mono text-sm tracking-[0.1em] text-muted-foreground lowercase">
        aws • golang • typescript • node.js • terraform
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="md:col-start-4 md:row-start-1 p-4 md:p-6 lg:p-8 border-b border-border/10 bg-foreground text-background flex flex-col">
      <SectionLabel class="bg-background text-foreground">Função</SectionLabel>
      <strong class="mt-3 font-sans text-xl lg:text-2xl xl:text-3xl font-bold uppercase leading-[1] -tracking-[0.02em] break-words">
        ENGENHEIRO DE SOFTWARE
      </strong>
      <dl class="mt-16 md:mt-24 flex flex-col">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-x-4 gap-y-1 border-t border-background/20 py-3">
          <dt class="font-mono text-[0.625rem] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-background/60">Base</dt>
          <dd class="font-mono text-[0.6875rem] md:text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.08em]">SÃO PAULO, SP</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-x-4 gap-y-1 border-t border-background/20 py-3">
          <dt class="font-mono text-[0.625rem] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-background/60">Atualmente</dt>
          <dd class="font-mono text-[0.6875rem] md:text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.08em]">R2 VENTURES</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t border-background/20 py-3">
          <dt class="font-mono text-[0.625rem] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-background/60">Formação</dt>
          <dd class="mt-2 font-mono text-[0.6875rem] md:text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.08em]">
            FIAP — CIÊNCIAS DA COMPUTAÇÃO
          </dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
